<title>USA: Halfmoon, N.Y., won by Trust Company Bank. [CORRECTED 21:47 GMT]</title>
<headline>Halfmoon, N.Y., won by Trust Company Bank. [CORRECTED 21:47 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company that won from Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc)</p>
<p>Trust Company Bank, said it won $2.230 million of Halfmoon, N.Y., water district serial bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.91431 (corrects from 5.122) percent.</p>
</text>
